---
// "How Cadence works" — guided walkthrough with real interface elements
// (BehaviorForm fields, OccurrenceRow tones, Needs decision group,
// OverallAdherence + legend), per the approved landing design.
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="page-section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="page-section__inner">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="how-title">How Cadence works</h2>
      <p>Four steps from a behavior you define to a record you own — shown with the actual interface.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hw-steps">
      <article class="hw-step">
        <div class="hw-copy">
          <span class="hw-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Define a behavior</h3>
            <p>Give it a title and a schedule: daily, every N days, weekly, or monthly, at exact times or ranges like Morning and Evening. Add a category, a description, and reminders if you want them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hw-visual hw-form" aria-label="Create behavior form, as in the app">
          <div class="hw-form__row hw-form__row--head">
            <label><span>Title</span><span class="hw-field">Evening reset</span></label>
            <label><span>Category</span><span class="hw-field hw-field--select">No category<span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-form__schedule">
            <span class="hw-form__legend">Schedule</span>
            <div class="hw-form__row hw-form__row--schedule">
              <label><span>Recurrence</span><span class="hw-field hw-field--select">Daily<span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></span></label>
              <label><span>Time</span><span class="hw-field">21:30</span></label>
              <span class="hw-action">Add time</span>
            </div>
            <span class="hw-action">Add schedule</span>
          </div>
          <label class="hw-form__check"><span class="hw-checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>Browser reminder at scheduled time</label>
          <div class="hw-form__actions">
            <span class="hw-action">Create behavior</span>
            <span class="hw-action hw-action--secondary">Cancel</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hw-step">
        <div class="hw-copy">
          <span class="hw-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Occurrences land on your timeline</h3>
            <p>Each scheduled slot becomes a dated entry on a today-first timeline. Yesterday's undecided items collect in a small Needs decision group — nothing is ever auto-marked missed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hw-visual hw-timeline" aria-label="Timeline with needs decision group, as in the app">
          <div class="hw-timeline__head">
            <span class="hw-quiet">Current day</span>
            <span class="hw-timeline__date">Tuesday, June 30</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-occ">
            <span class="hw-occ__time">Evening</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__title">Evening reset</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__actions"><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg><u>Completed</u></span><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18" /><path d="m6 6 12 12" /></svg><u>Not Completed</u></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-timeline__group">
            <span class="hw-quiet">Needs decision</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-occ hw-occ--needs">
            <span class="hw-occ__time hw-occ__time--strong">Yesterday</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__title">Morning walk</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__actions"><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg><u>Completed</u></span><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18" /><path d="m6 6 12 12" /></svg><u>Not Completed</u></span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hw-step">
        <div class="hw-copy">
          <span class="hw-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>You make the call</h3>
            <p>Mark each occurrence Completed or Not Completed, and attach a note for context. Undecided items simply stay Unresolved — each decision writes an append-only status event.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hw-visual" aria-label="Occurrence rows in each status tone, as in the app">
          <div class="hw-occ">
            <span class="hw-occ__time">Morning</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__title">Morning walk</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__actions"><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg><u>Completed</u></span><span class="status-action"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18" /><path d="m6 6 12 12" /></svg><u>Not Completed</u></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-occ hw-occ--completed">
            <span class="hw-occ__time">12:30 PM</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__title">Lunch notes</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__status">Completed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-occ hw-occ--not-completed">
            <span class="hw-occ__time">Evening</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__title">Read for twenty minutes</span>
            <span class="hw-occ__status">Not Completed</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hw-step">
        <div class="hw-copy">
          <span class="hw-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Review, then take it with you</h3>
            <p>Follow adherence across 7, 30, or 90 days on a calendar heatmap. Export the whole history whenever you want — JSONL, CSV, JSON, Markdown, or a BehaviorLog bundle.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hw-visual hw-review" aria-label="Overall adherence review, as in the app">
          <div class="hw-review__title">
            <span>Overall adherence:</span>
            <span class="hw-review__pct">80%</span>
          </div>
          <span class="hw-quiet">Range: Jun 24 – Jun 30</span>
          <div class="hw-ranges">
            <span class="is-active">7 days</span><span>30 days</span><span>90 days</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hw-review__grid">
            <div class="hw-heatmap">
              <span class="hw-cell"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell hw-cell--partial"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell hw-cell--nc"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell hw-cell--unresolved"></span>
              <span class="hw-cell"></span>
            </div>
            <ul class="hw-legend">
              <li><span class="hw-swatch"></span>100% Completed</li>
              <li><span class="hw-swatch hw-swatch--partial"></span>Partial</li>
              <li><span class="hw-swatch hw-swatch--nc"></span>Not Completed</li>
              <li><span class="hw-swatch hw-swatch--unresolved"></span>Unresolved</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hw-steps { display: grid; }

  .hw-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(20rem, 0.9fr);
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 3rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hw-step:last-child { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .hw-copy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.25rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .hw-copy > div { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .hw-copy h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .hw-copy p { font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 52ch; }

  .hw-num { color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.5; }

  .hw-visual {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--background);
  }

  .hw-quiet { color: var(--muted-readable); font-size: 0.75rem; }

  /* step 01 — create form */
  .hw-form { padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; display: grid; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .hw-form__row--head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(9rem, 11rem);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .hw-form label { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .hw-field {
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .hw-field--select { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .hw-field--select > span { color: var(--muted-readable); }
  .hw-form__schedule { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .hw-form__legend { font-size: 1rem; }
  .hw-form__row--schedule {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(9rem, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: end;
  }
  .hw-action {
    justify-self: start;
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hw-action--secondary { color: var(--muted-readable); }
  .hw-form__check {
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
  }
  .hw-checkbox {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--primary);
  }
  .hw-form__actions { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: baseline; }

  /* steps 02/03 — occurrence rows */
  .hw-timeline__head {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem 0.6rem;
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hw-timeline__date { display: block; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .hw-timeline__group { padding: 0.6rem 1rem 0.5rem; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--line); }

  .hw-occ {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5.75rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
  }
  .hw-occ__time { color: var(--muted-readable); font-size: 0.75rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hw-occ__time--strong { color: var(--foreground); }
  .hw-occ__title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hw-occ__actions { display: flex; gap: 0.875rem; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .status-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    color: var(--foreground);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .status-action svg { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .hw-occ__actions u { text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
  .hw-occ__status { font-size: 0.75rem; white-space: nowrap; }

  .hw-occ--needs { background: var(--surface); }
  .hw-occ--completed { background: var(--primary); color: var(--background); }
  .hw-occ--completed .hw-occ__time { color: inherit; }
  .hw-occ--not-completed { background: var(--accent); color: var(--background); }
  .hw-occ--not-completed .hw-occ__time { color: inherit; }

  /* step 04 — adherence review */
  .hw-review { padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem; display: grid; gap: 0.875rem; }
  .hw-review__title { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 0 0.75rem; }
  .hw-review__title span { font-size: 1.25rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hw-review__pct { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .hw-ranges { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .hw-ranges span {
    color: var(--muted-readable);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .hw-ranges .is-active { color: var(--foreground); }

  .hw-review__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 16rem max-content;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .hw-heatmap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 4px; }
  .hw-cell {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    min-height: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--primary);
  }
  .hw-cell--partial { background: #9ab8d9; }
  .hw-cell--nc { background: var(--accent); }
  .hw-cell--unresolved { background: var(--surface); }

  .hw-legend {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted-readable);
  }
  .hw-legend li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hw-swatch {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--primary);
  }
  .hw-swatch--partial { background: #9ab8d9; }
  .hw-swatch--nc { background: var(--accent); }
  .hw-swatch--unresolved { background: var(--surface); }

  @media (width < 820px) {
    .hw-step { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .hw-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .hw-review__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
